@startuml
' Opsy — UML component and data-flow architecture
' Visual contract: user-provided Shopify Operations Skill UML reference.
' Content authority: current Opsy repository only.

title
<size:28><b>Opsy — UML 组件与数据流架构图</b></size>
<size:16><color:#64748B>1 个注册 Skill · 6 个内部工作流 · 4 组长期项目状态 · 本地快照数据 · 双批准 Shopify 写入</color></size>
end title

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F6F9FC
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 32
skinparam ranksep 38
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultFontColor #17243A
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam packageFontColor #334155
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam ClassAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ClassBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ClassBorderColor #334155
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #DCEBFA
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #8FC4F7
skinparam ClassFontColor #17243A
skinparam ClassFontStyle bold
skinparam ClassAttributeFontStyle plain
skinparam ClassAttributeFontColor #334155
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B89B56
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8D8
skinparam NoteFontColor #3F3A2F

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<operator>> #E2E8F0
  BorderColor<<operator>> #475569
  BackgroundColor<<runtime>> #B9D9F7
  BorderColor<<runtime>> #2563A6
  BackgroundColor<<config>> #E6CCFF
  BorderColor<<config>> #7C3AED
  BackgroundColor<<input>> #FFF8D8
  BorderColor<<input>> #B89B56
  BackgroundColor<<asset>> #E2E8F0
  BorderColor<<asset>> #64748B
  BackgroundColor<<evidence>> #C8E0F8
  BorderColor<<evidence>> #2563A6
  BackgroundColor<<workflow>> #C5E0FA
  BorderColor<<workflow>> #2563A6
  BackgroundColor<<validator>> #C5E0FA
  BorderColor<<validator>> #2563A6
  BackgroundColor<<workspace>> #BDF3D9
  BorderColor<<workspace>> #15803D
  BackgroundColor<<gate>> #FFD8A8
  BorderColor<<gate>> #C2410C
  BackgroundColor<<shopify>> #BDF3D9
  BorderColor<<shopify>> #15803D
  BackgroundColor<<external>> #E2E8F0
  BorderColor<<external>> #64748B
}

hide circle
hide stereotype

class "Operator / Codex Task" as Operator <<operator>> {
  + request(outcome, projectRoot)
}

class "OpsyRuntime" as Runtime <<runtime>> [[../../skills/opsy/SKILL.md]] {
  - skillRoot : skills/opsy
  - businessModel : b2b_inquiry
  - dataAccess : delivered_snapshots_only
  + preflight(projectRoot)
  + statusAndCapabilityGates()
  + routeOneOperatorGoal()
  + enforceApprovalAndReadback()
}

Operator -[#475569,bold]-> Runtime : preflight

package "跨 Skill / 包链接" as CrossSkillLinks {
  class "Shopify Operations Skill" as AgencySkill <<external>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/agency-handoff.md]] {
    + exportReviewedMerchantTasks()
  }
  class "opsy-merchant-handoff.csv" as AgencyHandoff <<evidence>> {
    - contract : opsy-agency-handoff-v1
    - status : ready_for_merchant
    + importWithoutWriteApproval()
  }
  class "Opsy DTC" as OpsyDtc <<external>> {
    + handleCheckoutLedStore()
  }

  AgencySkill -[#2563A6]-> AgencyHandoff : 已审核任务
  AgencyHandoff -[#2563A6]-> Runtime : import-agency-handoff
  Runtime -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> OpsyDtc : checkout-led only
}

class "WorkspaceResolver" as Resolver <<operator>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/project-layout.md]] {
  - shopify-ops.json
  - AGENTS.md
  + resolveNearestMarker()
  + preserveExistingWorkspace()
}

diamond "Primary\nWorkflow\nRouter" as Router #FFF0B8

Resolver -[#475569]-> Router : project + workspace
Runtime -[#475569,bold]-> Router : state + allowed choices

note right of Router
  一次只加载一个内部工作流。
  Product / Blog / 404 等不是
  独立安装 Skill；它们共享同一
  Opsy Runtime、配置和安全门。
end note

package "项目规则、长期画像与 FAQ（采集输入不等于事实库）" as ConfigLayer {
  class "ProjectAndWorkspaceConfig" as ProjectConfig <<config>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/project-layout.md]] {
    - shopify-ops.json
    - AGENTS.md
    - workspace path
    + locateProjectAndRules()
  }

  class "ProfileInputEvidence" as ProfileInputs <<input>> [[../../skills/opsy/assets/workspace/config/business-questionnaire.md]] {
    - config/business-questionnaire.md
    - inbox/profile/YYYY-MM-DD/audience-intake.json
    - Shopify read-only profile readback
    + promoteConfirmedSummaryOnly()
  }

  class "StoreProfileConfig" as StoreProfile <<config>> [[../../skills/opsy/assets/workspace/config/store-profile.json]] {
    - config/store-profile.json
    - store + connection
    - profile.store_role
    - profile.content_voice
    - profile.merchant_context
    - markets / languages / primary_inquiry_cta
    + provideConfirmedProfile()
  }

  class "FaqSourceEvidence" as FaqSources <<input>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/buyer-faq-contract.md]] {
    - inbox/faq/BATCH/source-*
    - question / answer / language / source
    + normalizeAndReviewConflicts()
  }

  class "BuyerFaqConfig" as BuyerFaq <<config>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/buyer-faq-contract.md]] {
    - config/buyer_faq.json
    - audience_signals / faq_items
    - conflicts / quarantine
    + provideEligibleQuestionsAndRoutes()
  }

  ProjectConfig -[hidden]down-> ProfileInputs
  ProfileInputs -[#B89B56]-> StoreProfile : 确认摘要 / 只读回读
  StoreProfile -[hidden]down-> FaqSources
  FaqSources -[#B89B56]-> BuyerFaq : 规范化 + 人工审核
}

note right of StoreProfile
  画像事实库 = config/store-profile.json
  FAQ 不提供 connection、角色、市场、语气或 CTA。
end note

package "Manifest 声明的数据与经营证据" as EvidenceLayer {
  class "EvidenceManifest" as Manifest <<evidence>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/data-contract.md]] {
    - data-center/manifest.json
    - source / scope / timezone
    - date_range / pulled_at / row_count
    + verifyDeclaredDatasetContract()
  }

  class "SearchEvidence" as SearchEvidence <<evidence>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/data-contract.md]] {
    - gsc_queries.csv
    - gsc_pages.csv
    - gsc_query_page.csv
    - gsc_not_found.csv optional
    + routeDemandPagesAnd404s()
  }

  class "AnalyticsEvidence" as AnalyticsEvidence <<evidence>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/data-contract.md]] {
    - ga4_channels.csv
    - ga4_landing_pages.csv
    - ga4_direct_unassigned_quality.csv
    - ga4_effective_channels.csv
    + summarizeLandingAndChannelSignals()
  }

  class "MerchantSourceEvidence" as MerchantEvidence <<evidence>> [[../opsy-project-file-inventory.md]] {
    - inbox/products/*
    - inbox/content/*
    - images / video / sheets / sales facts
    + preserveSourceRefsAndUnknowns()
  }

  Manifest -[hidden]down-> SearchEvidence
  SearchEvidence -[hidden]down-> AnalyticsEvidence
  AnalyticsEvidence -[hidden]down-> MerchantEvidence
}

ProjectConfig -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> Runtime : 项目定位与规则
StoreProfile -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> Runtime : store-profile.json → 连接 / 角色 / 市场 / 语气 / CTA
BuyerFaq -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> Runtime : buyer_faq.json → FAQ 问题 / 异议 / 答案资格 / 路由

Manifest -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Runtime : 活动数据集与新鲜度
SearchEvidence -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Runtime : 搜索需求 / 404
AnalyticsEvidence -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Runtime : 落地页 / 渠道表现
MerchantEvidence -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Runtime : 产品和内容事实

ConfigLayer -[hidden]right- Runtime
Runtime -[hidden]right- EvidenceLayer

package "6 个 Opsy 内部工作流 · Router 一次选择一个" as Workflows {
  class "Connection & Profile" as ConnectionFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-connection-profile.md]] {
    + connectReadOnlyAndConfirmProfile()
  }
  class "Next Actions" as ActionsFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-next-actions.md]] {
    + returnExactlyThreeActions()
  }
  class "Product Operations" as ProductFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-products.md]] {
    + buildDecisionAndProductPackage()
  }
  class "Blog & Content" as BlogFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-blog.md]] {
    + chooseDataBackedOrFaqSeededTopic()
  }
  class "404 Redirect" as RedirectFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-404.md]] {
    + triageAndSelectExactRedirects()
  }
  class "Monthly Data" as MonthlyFlow <<workflow>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/workflow-monthly-data.md]] {
    + validateSummarizeSuggestKeywords()
  }

  ConnectionFlow -[hidden]right-> ActionsFlow
  ActionsFlow -[hidden]right-> ProductFlow
  ConnectionFlow -[hidden]down-> BlogFlow
  ActionsFlow -[hidden]down-> RedirectFlow
  ProductFlow -[hidden]down-> MonthlyFlow
  BlogFlow -[hidden]right-> RedirectFlow
  RedirectFlow -[hidden]right-> MonthlyFlow
}

Router -[#C2410C,bold]-> Workflows : route exactly one

StoreProfile -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> Workflows : 已确认画像与写作边界
BuyerFaq -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> Workflows : 合格问题与答案资格
Manifest -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Workflows : manifest-declared only
MerchantEvidence -[#2563A6,dashed]-> Workflows : source facts / media

class "SpecialistValidators" as Validators <<validator>> [[../../skills/opsy/scripts/opsy.mjs]] {
  + validateDataCenter()
  + validateBuyerFaqAndAudienceIntake()
  + validateDecisionProductBlogPackages()
  + validateNextActions()
  + guardMutationAndCheckResponse()
  + return(pass | warning | blocker)
}

Workflows -[#475569,bold]-> Validators : candidate artifacts

package "Client Workspace · 客户私有，可迁移，升级不得覆盖" as ClientWorkspace {
  class "outputs/" as Outputs <<workspace>> {
    - product-package.json
    - blog-package.json
    - next-actions.json
    - monthly/keyword-suggestions-*.csv
    - 404/404-queue.csv
    - agency-handoff/*.csv
    + keepEvidencePathsAndReadback()
  }

  class "backups/ + tmp/opsy/" as SafetyState <<workspace>> {
    - pre-write snapshots
    - query / variables / sanitized response
    + preserveExactOperationState()
  }

  class "ai-log/" as AuditLog <<workspace>> {
    - operations-log.md
    - handle-changes.csv
    + recordOutcomeWithoutCredentials()
  }

  Outputs -[hidden]right-> SafetyState
  SafetyState -[hidden]right-> AuditLog
}

class "GraphQLAndToolchainAssets" as GraphqlAssets <<asset>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/shopify-cli.md]] {
  - Skill package asset; not client profile
  - assets/toolchain.json
  - assets/graphql/*.graphql
  - *.variables.example.json
  + pinCommandAndOperationContract()
}

class "SharedWriteGate" as WriteGate <<gate>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/safety-and-approvals.md]] {
  + requireWorkflowWriteCapability()
  + requirePreWriteSnapshot()
  + requireExactFieldPreview()
  + requireExplicitApprovalA()
  + requireGuardedVariables()
  + requireReadbackBeforeApprovalB()
}

class "Shopify Admin / Public Site" as Shopify <<shopify>> [[../../skills/opsy/references/shopify-cli.md]] {
  + approvedDraftOrUpdate()
  + adminReadback()
  + approvalBPublishOrSchedule()
  + publicPageReadback()
}

Validators -[#15803D,bold]-> Outputs : validated local deliverables
Validators -[#C2410C,bold]-> WriteGate : write candidate only
GraphqlAssets -[#C2410C,dashed]-> WriteGate : exact operation template
WriteGate -[#C2410C,bold]-> Shopify : explicit approved scope
WriteGate -[#15803D]-> SafetyState : snapshot + operation files
Shopify -[#15803D,dashed]-> AuditLog : Admin / public readback
Shopify -[#15803D,dashed]-> Outputs : verified result

Outputs -[hidden]right-> WriteGate
WriteGate -[hidden]right-> Shopify

note right of EvidenceLayer
  原始 CSV 不改写；只有 manifest 声明的文件是活动数据。
  Product 可无 Google 数据运行；Blog 需要 GSC + GA4，
  或使用合格 FAQ 问题进入不含虚构指标的 faq_seeded 冷启动。
end note

note bottom of ClientWorkspace
  business-questionnaire.md 是填写入口；audience-intake.json 是日期证据。
  只有确认摘要进入 store-profile.json；输出包不会反写成第二份事实库。
end note

legend bottom
  |= 颜色 / 线型 |= 含义 |
  |<#E6CCFF>　</#E6CCFF>| 客户长期项目配置 |
  |<#FFF8D8>　</#FFF8D8>| 采集输入 / 只读回读；确认后才晋升为画像或 FAQ |
  |<#E2E8F0>　</#E2E8F0>| Skill 包内只读操作模板；不是客户画像 |
  |<#C8E0F8>　</#C8E0F8>| manifest 管理的数据与经营证据 |
  |<#C5E0FA>　</#C5E0FA>| Runtime、工作流和专业校验器 |
  |<#BDF3D9>　</#BDF3D9>| 客户 Workspace、审计落盘与 Shopify 回读 |
  |<#FFD8A8>　</#FFD8A8>| 需要明确批准的写入门 |
  |虚线依赖| 读取、条件证据或跨包路由；不自动授权写入 |
endlegend

@enduml
